{"id":"5334a7b3a430e884","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere.md","title":"形式测度下界的几乎处处传播","display":"thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere — 形式测度下界的几乎处处传播","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere","aliases":["28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere"],"display":"thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere — 形式测度下界的几乎处处传播","depends_on":["[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 23.7","source_printed_pages":"503","source_pdf_pages":"529","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere — 形式测度下界的几乎处处传播"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc32a2c3b871a820\" href=\"?note=cc32a2c3b871a820\" title=\"28-df-formal-complexity-measure\">28-df-formal-complexity-measure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 23.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"503"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"529"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-compared; proof-not-independently-verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\">\\(\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc32a2c3b871a820\" href=\"?note=cc32a2c3b871a820\" title=\"28-df-formal-complexity-measure\">28-df-formal-complexity-measure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log_2\">\\(\\log_2\\)</span> 为二底对数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S&gt;0\">\\(S&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in(0,1)\">\\(\\epsilon\\in(0,1)\\)</span>。函数 g 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n\">\\(\\mathcal B_n\\)</span> 上均匀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c&gt;0\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;\\forall S&gt;0\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in(0,1)\\quad\\left[\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\land\\mu(f)&gt;S\\Rightarrow\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:\\mu(g)\\ge cS/(n+\\log_2(1/\\epsilon))^2\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge1-\\epsilon\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c&gt;0\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;\\forall S&gt;0\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in(0,1)\\quad\\left[\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\land\\mu(f)&gt;S\\Rightarrow\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:\\mu(g)\\ge cS/(n+\\log_2(1/\\epsilon))^2\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge1-\\epsilon\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把原书 Ω 记号展开为统一正常数 c，量词先于 n、测度、函数和 ε。本书将证明留作 Exercise 23.1；本次只比对定理陈述与常数独立性，没有提供完整局部证明，因而不能作为已核验证明依赖。实数值版本若证明需整数性应另复核；本条在写出时保守增加 μ 的整数值前提。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 23.7；印刷页 503；PDF 页 529。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-formal-complexity-measure","status":"resolved","id":"cc32a2c3b871a820","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-formal-complexity-measure","status":"resolved","id":"cc32a2c3b871a820","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)$ 见 [[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]；$\\log_2$ 为二底对数，$S>0$，$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$。函数 g 在 $\\mathcal B_n$ 上均匀。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n,\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)","display":false},{"tex":"\\log_2","display":false},{"tex":"S>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon\\in(0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists c>0\\;\\forall n\\ge1\\;\\forall\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathcal B_n\\;\\forall S>0\\;\\forall\\epsilon\\in(0,1)\\quad\\left[\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\land\\mu(f)>S\\Rightarrow\\frac{|\\{g\\in\\mathcal B_n:\\mu(g)\\ge cS/(n+\\log_2(1/\\epsilon))^2\\}|}{2^{2^n}}\\ge1-\\epsilon\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1707,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-413","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound]]、[[28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere]]、[[28-df-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]、[[28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound]]、[[28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness]]、[[28-ex-singleton-property-not-large]]。"}],"outgoing":["cc32a2c3b871a820"]}